Test file: `Blockchain/Dev/services/m365-integration/src/__tests__/ks1364-onedrive-file-sync-body-required.test.ts`  (NEW, 43 lines)
Tip: `723dc0722b68482a03de8577fdb5eb5b3359e725` (origin develop, `git ls-remote` 2026-10-01 09:47 AEST, the base Wednesday named at 09:15). `m365-integration.openapi.ts` there is 1062 lines.
