- Collision: 23 open PRs (GitHub REST `GET /pulls?state=open` + `/pulls/N/files`, read 2026-10-01 ~09:55 and re-read 10:21 AEST, unchanged). None touches `Blockchain/Dev/services/m365-integration/src/m365-integration.openapi.ts`, any `*.openapi.ts`, or `docs/openapi/secuura-api.yaml`. #575, #649, #948 touch `services/m365-integration/package.json` and #1360 its `package-lock.json` only.
